        <mxCell id="d1" value="① 음성 앱 (speech)&#10;STT→LLM→TTS · Python+PyTorch · GPU&#10;&#10;✅ 달성&#10;28/28 테스트 · 2GB profiler 실측&#10;swap=@register+YAML&#10;⚠ TTS 음질 교체 PENDING" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="64" width="250" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d2" value="② lowering (feature/sslnpu-kernels)&#10;PyTorch→MLIR for target app&#10;&#10;⚠ 부분달성&#10;block_scaled_q8 swap seam · WM3(rel 0.8%)&#10;RK1/RK2(RSS 3–4.6×↓) · VP0 riscv64&#10;✅ target 정렬(Llama 통일)&#10;⚠ TTS lowering 미진" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="325" y="64" width="250" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d3" value="③ VP 배포 (feature/vp-deployment)&#10;CPU-only SoC VP · RISC-V64 포팅&#10;&#10;⚠ 부분 (부팅~엔진 복구)&#10;ssl-soc-gen2 2GB 부팅 ✅&#10;static llama-cli 재빌드 ✅(ABI 버그 수정)&#10;❌ 실제 토큰 생성 · STT/TTS · 오케스트레이션" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="64" width="250" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
